    "created_at": "2017-06-20T10:02:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-20T10:02:03Z",
    "body": "The outer fieldset renders as a normal fieldset (without a legend); the inner fieldset honors display:contents, and the legend is a normal block (because \"display:contents on fieldset means it can't have any potential rendered legend\").\r\n\r\nI can work on a pull request and tests to make things clearer. I'll also check WebKit and EdgeHTML.",
