    "created_at": "2018-08-13T13:31:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-13T13:31:10Z",
    "body": "Per comments in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3331 it appears that this is implemented differently to what I suggested would happen above. In particular, the with example above, the outer fieldset has the legend as its rendered legend in WebKit/Chromium/Gecko. (EdgeHTML 17 doesn't support `display: contents`.)",
